 p explores the foundational elements of Islamic art\, from geometry and pr
 oportion to rhythm and ornament\, with a particular focus on geometric and
  floral motifs.\n\nThrough guided exploration and mindful experimentation 
 with Gel plate monoprinting\, participants will learn techniques such as l
 ayering\, masking\, and texture transfer to create original prints. This r
 elaxed\, process-oriented workshop invites reflection on the interplay bet
 ween colour\, form\, and pattern\, resulting in vibrant\, one-of-a-kind wo
 rks inspired by the timeless beauty of our collections.
